message: "If you use this dataset and code, please cite the archived release."
title: "Processed eddy covariance carbon flux data and analysis scripts for Michigan apple orchards (2023–2025)"
version: 1.0.0
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Postma
    given-names: Kevin
    affiliation: Michigan State University
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-7415-7148"
abstract: >-
  This repository contains processed eddy covariance carbon flux data,
  quality-control and manual-review records, analysis scripts, figures,
  and manuscript-supporting tables for a study of Michigan apple orchards
  from 2023 through 2025.
keywords:
  - eddy covariance
  - apple orchard
  - carbon flux
  - net ecosystem exchange
  - gross primary productivity
  - ecosystem respiration
  - Michigan
  - orchard systems
